00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:54.320
Voici l'astuce.

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:55.840
Le portail Azure peut réellement

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:56.680
générer des modèles ARM

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:57.900
